          content: >-
            Decision: PROCEED


            • North America: revenue $2,775.6k vs target $2,520k, forecast $3,125.7k,
            quality 1.0, on track.

            • Europe: revenue $2,091.7k vs target $2,040k, forecast $2,468.6k, quality
