            threshold.

            • Asia Pacific: revenue $1,699.9k vs target $1,440k, forecast $2,175.9k
            (strongest growth at 4.2%), on track.


            Portfolio forecast $7,770.2k comfortably exceeds target $6,000k and all
            regions are on track with quality scores at threshold, supporting the proposed
            "proceed" decision.


            Next action: Audit and re-verify Europe's backfilled revenue inputs before the
            next reporting cycle to confirm forecast reliability.
